<title>USA: First Financial names chairman.</title>
<headline>First Financial names chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Ohio 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Bancorp on Friday said its board of directors elected Barry Levey as its chairman.</p>
<p>Levey, a former Ohio state senator who had served on the board since 1985, is replacing Richard Fitton, who retired at the annual shareholders meeting on April 22, said the bank, which is based in Hamilton, Ohio.</p>
